Subject: [PATCH] sepolicy: cupid HAL domain rules

Local production changes for Xiaomi 12 (cupid), snapshot 2026-09-14.

     common/dynamic/hal_lineage_health.te            |  2 ++
     common/dynamic/hal_lineage_livedisplay.te       |  2 ++
     common/dynamic/hal_lineage_powershare.te        |  2 ++
     common/dynamic/hal_lineage_touch.te             |  2 ++
     common/vendor/hal_lineage_health_default.te     |  8 ++++++++
     common/vendor/hal_lineage_livedisplay_sysfs.te  |  8 ++++++++
     common/vendor/hal_lineage_powershare_default.te |  8 ++++++++
     common/vendor/hal_lineage_touch_default.te      |  8 ++++++++
     qcom/dynamic/hal_lineage_livedisplay_sysfs.te   |  3 +++
     qcom/vendor/fm_app.te                           |  2 ++
     qcom/vendor/hal_gnss_qti.te                     |  2 ++
     qcom/vendor/hal_lineage_health_default.te       |  9 +++++++--
     qcom/vendor/hal_lineage_livedisplay_qti.te      |  8 ++++++++
     qcom/vendor/hal_perf_default.te                 |  3 ++-
     qcom/vendor/hal_power_default.te                | 15 ++++++++++-----
     15 files changed, 74 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
